      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "49 Coille Tíre, Doughiska, Galway, H91 DA0P presents a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious three-bedroom mid-terrace home in one of Doughiska’s most sought-after, well-managed developments. \r\n\r\nTucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac overlooking a central green area, this property offers 93.58 sq m of bright, modern living space ideal for families, first-time buyers, or investors alike. The ground floor opens into a bright entrance hallway featuring wooden flooring. \r\n\r\nTo the front, a spacious living room centered around a feature fireplace looks directly onto the green. \r\n\r\nThe rear of the home features an open-plan kitchen and dining area fitted with ample cabinetry, a tiled backsplash, and sliding glass doors that open out to the garden. An adjoining utility room provides extra storage and laundry space, accompanied by a ground-floor WC. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, the layout comprises three double bedrooms with fitted storage space, including a master bedroom with an ensuite bathroom. A well-appointed main family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms. \r\n\r\nExternally, the property boasts a low-maintenance, fully enclosed rear garden finished with gravel and a paved walkway, surrounded by privacy walls. Off-street paved parking is available directly outside. \r\n\r\nBuilt in 2005, the property holds an impressive B Building Energy Rating (BER), ensuring excellent energy efficiency and comfort year-round. Ideally situated, 49 Coille Tíre enjoys convenient access to Merlin Woods, local primary and secondary schools, Castlegar GAA grounds, Briarhill Shopping Centre, and major employment hubs including Parkmore and Ballybrit Industrial Estates. Regular bus routes provide quick connection directly into Galway City Centre. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
